5.8 Microsoft Teams

Microsoft Teams is a collaboration platform used for:

Chat
Meetings
Voice/video communication
File collaboration
Team/channel-based work

Teams can integrate with SharePoint for file storage and collaboration.

5.9 Microsoft 365 Admin Center

The Microsoft 365 Admin Center provides centralized administration for areas such as:

Users
Groups
Licenses
Services
Service health
Organization settings
Help Desk Relevance

If a large number of users suddenly report that Teams or Outlook is unavailable, checking Microsoft 365 service health can help determine whether the problem is service-wide rather than local.

5.10 Microsoft Entra ID

Microsoft Entra ID is Microsoft's cloud-based identity and access management service.

It provides capabilities involving:

User identities
Authentication
Groups
Applications
Access management
MFA
Basic Comparison
Traditional Active Directory
↓
